@startuml
title Context Diagram - Combined View 2 (Backend Layered Module Architecture)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Customer / Seller / Administrator" as User
rectangle "React Web App" as FE
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
rectangle ".NET 10 RESTful API\n(Scoped Element of View 2)" as API

User --> FE : uses web interface
FE --> API : auth / products / carts /\norders / seller / admin requests
API --> DB : persist business data /\naudit data

note left of FE
Outside this view:
frontend routing, UI composition,
client-side state and rendering.
end note

note bottom of DB
Outside this view:
schema design, deployment,
backup and operational setup.
end note

@enduml
